          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "The replacement estimate now has a concrete form: after certifying the roots and a lower bound for the remaining factor, product integration gives an error proportional to the square of panel width. This removes E06’s explicit \\(1/\\delta\\) term, but the root certificates and factor bound are still unpaid. I’ll record that distinction and prepare a bounded analytical audit as the next step."
            ]
